{"unit_id":"Mr-remon219__dsh-search-boost#card-zh","repo":"Mr-remon219/dsh-search-boost","commit":"be1c151741dee5844daf75c3b4b93dbc6bb85c57","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-search-boost**（DSH 网页客户端插件）：为网页检索、页面阅读和 X 内容查询提供搜索增强。它通过 bundle patch 接管内置 web_search 与 web_fetch，并注册融合搜索、页面抓取、X 搜索、深度研究、并行研究和搜索统计工具。检索可并行调用免费引擎并融合去重结果，也可按需启用 API 引擎；页面工具支持主题聚焦，X 搜索在无凭据时仍有回退流程。适合需要联网查证、阅读网页或汇总多来源资料的 DSH 用户。免费搜索和基础 X 回退无需额外密钥；API 引擎及官方 X 搜索凭据为可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:70-105","cordis.patch.yml:6-13","lib/engines.js:19-38"]}
{"unit_id":"Mr-remon219__dsh-search-boost#card-en","repo":"Mr-remon219/dsh-search-boost","commit":"be1c151741dee5844daf75c3b4b93dbc6bb85c57","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-search-boost** (DSH web plugin) replaces built-in web search and fetch, and adds fused search, focused page reading, X lookup, deep and parallel research, and stats. It combines keyless engines, with optional API engines and official X access. Basic search and X fallback need no key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:70-105","cordis.patch.yml:6-13","lib/engines.js:19-38"]}
